---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import EmailLink from '../components/EmailLink.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for No Lock-In Printer, including hosting, analytics choices, advertising disclosures, affiliate links, and third-party services."
>
  <article class="article">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--amber);">Privacy policy</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lead">This policy explains how the site uses hosting, advertising, affiliate links, contact email, and optional analytics choices.</p>

    <section class="article-section">
      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        The site is a static website. We do not require accounts and do not provide an email signup form. If you contact the published email address, the email provider may process the address, message, and delivery metadata you choose to send.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="article-section">
      <h2>Hosting and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may process request metadata such as IP address, user agent, URL, and security signals to deliver and protect the site.
      </p>
      <p>
        No Lock-In Printer uses Google Analytics 4 to understand page visits, content usage, aggregate interaction performance, and site improvements. Google Analytics loads only after you allow analytics where consent is required. You can reject analytics, withdraw consent, or reopen analytics choices from the footer.
      </p>
      <p>
        Analytics events use low-cardinality labels such as content type, slug, and placement. They are not designed to send email addresses, names, contact message text, newsletter input, or other personal content.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="article-section">
      <h2>Advertising cookies</h2>
      <p>The site includes Google AdSense publisher configuration. Third-party vendors, including Google, may use cookies, web beacons, IP addresses, or similar identifiers to serve and measure ads. Analytics choices are separate from advertising choices and do not grant ad storage, ad user data, or ad personalization consent.</p>
      <p>You can control or opt out of personalized Google advertising through <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/">Google Ads Settings</a>. Additional industry opt-out choices are available at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/">aboutads.info</a>.</p>
      <p>Google explains how it uses information from partner sites and apps on its <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">partner-sites data page</a>.</p>
      <p>If a Google-certified consent management platform or Funding Choices configuration is used for advertising, it remains separate from the site's analytics choices.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="article-section">
      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>
        Outbound retailer links may include affiliate or sponsored tracking parameters. Those third-party sites have their own privacy policies and may collect information after you leave No Lock-In Printer.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="article-section">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Privacy questions can be sent to <EmailLink user="hello" domain="nolockinprinter.com" />.
      </p>
    </section>
    <p>Last updated July 27, 2026.</p>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
